---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Case Studies — Coyote & Quill"
  description="Anonymized case studies demonstrating AI integration, compliance architecture, and custom tooling in production environments."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label">Case Studies</p>
      <h1>The work, not the pitch.</h1>
      <p>Anonymized engagements demonstrating AI integration, compliance architecture, and custom tooling delivered in production environments — not sandboxes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="placeholder-section">
        <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Coming — Phase 2 Launch Gate</p>
        <p>Case studies are being prepared for publication. All client details are anonymized.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px;">First case study covers: AI integration architecture at a healthcare startup — MCP server design, compliance workflow automation, and UAT tooling across product and operations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="label">What's Coming</p>
        <h2>Topics in preparation.</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">Case Study 01</p>
          <h3>AI Integration at a Healthcare Startup</h3>
          <p>MCP server architecture connecting Claude to compliance toolkits, UAT management, and configuration systems — built and deployed in a HIPAA-regulated environment.</p>
          <p style="color: var(--slate-grey); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 16px;">Status: In preparation</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">Case Study 02</p>
          <h3>Compliance Architecture &amp; Audit Readiness</h3>
          <p>Designing HIPAA, FDA 21 CFR Part 11, and SOC 2 compliance frameworks simultaneously for a startup with no dedicated compliance staff.</p>
          <p style="color: var(--slate-grey); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 16px;">Status: In preparation</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">Case Study 03</p>
          <h3>Custom Tooling — Requirements to UAT</h3>
          <p>Building a Python toolkit that converts product requirements into user stories, UAT test cases, and compliance documentation — reducing a multi-day manual process to minutes.</p>
          <p style="color: var(--slate-grey); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 16px;">Status: In preparation</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Don't Wait</p>
      <h2 style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 24px;">The track record is real. Let's talk about your problem.</h2>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
